Subject: [PATCH 106/202] [ae-patch] Let an extension open a Databricks
 workspace or SQL warehouse link

The Admin Center's Databricks section offers "Open in Databricks" for the
workspace and each SQL warehouse, but navigation.openExternal admitted only
GitHub, Azure portal and Fabric links, so the page fell back to Copy. Two
shapes are now admitted on any one-label workspace host under
cloud.databricks.com, https with no userinfo, port, query or fragment: the
workspace root, with or without its slash, and /sql/warehouses/<16 hex id>.
A punycode label is refused, so a lookalike name cannot show as Unicode.
